From df548110dbfcdf13da8351275c0053883eac019c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Apr 2026 08:57:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] fix: wire promptFileReadVerified, pass nodeId to node
 overrides, remove cron dead code

- Wire onToolUse callback in JSONL streaming parser to set
  promptFileReadVerified when Claude reads the system prompt file
  (Layer 1 pre-flight guard was always failing and degrading to
  disabled mode)
- Pass nodeId/displayName to resolveNodeCommandAllowlist at connect
  reconciliation and pending action filtering call sites so per-node
  overrides take effect everywhere
- Remove 377 lines of unreachable dead code in cron/isolated-agent/run.ts
  (old monolithic function body superseded by finalizeCronRun refactor)
- Fix feishu rebase artifacts: duplicate monitorFeishuProvider export,
  missing getGlobalHookRunner re-export, bot.test mock type mismatch
- Remove vestigial if(true) wrapper around Layer 3 budget guard

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
